          <rdf:li>Post-Traumatic Stress Disorder - PTSD</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra Needs Therapy (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora Needs Therapy (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>really everyone needs therapy</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>post s5</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mating Bites</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra and Adora were in a relationship before</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver liked to mind wipe them</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Abusive Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Flashbacks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra is more magicat than she realizes</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra and Adora are in love and always have been</rdf:li>
